ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 20255, Sep. 10, 2007>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Relationship with other statutes and regulations)
In cases where other statutes and regulations cite the Enforcement Decree of the Hyanggyo Property Act or its provisions at the time of enforcement of this Decree, if provisions corresponding thereto exist in this Decree, this Decree or the corresponding provisions of this Decree shall be deemed cited in lieu of the previous provisions.

